Allowed tactic combinations: 17
Diagnostic: gc.collect() and prior-sim drop at reset start enabled.
Vector env start method: fork
Policy arch: variant_a (shared 512->256 ReLU trunk via SharedTrunkExtractor, pi/vf heads of 128, ReLU)
Using cpu device
PPO hyperparams: lr=0.0005 (decay^0.65), n_epochs=7, gamma=0.99, target_kl=None
